WEBVTT

00:08:28.840 --> 00:08:35.120
If somebody tries this
and is only 0.1 percent effective,

00:08:35.144 --> 00:08:36.947
eight million people die.

00:08:36.971 --> 00:08:40.610
That's 2,500 9/11s.

00:08:40.634 --> 00:08:43.040
Civilization would survive,

00:08:43.064 --> 00:08:45.850
but it would be permanently disfigured.

00:08:46.586 --> 00:08:49.736
So this means we need
to be concerned about anybody

00:08:49.760 --> 00:08:51.884
who has the faintest shot on goal,

00:08:51.908 --> 00:08:53.775
not just geniuses.

00:08:54.688 --> 00:08:59.735
So today, there's a tiny
handful of geniuses

00:08:59.759 --> 00:09:01.901
who probably could make a doomsday bug